R You Ready for Something New?
Try R On Us <http://post.oreilly.com/rd/9z1zfvfsnlbu73u307r80rmgu4np6543rre9lnaug5o>

We're excited to announce our partnering with Code School to offer a free introductory course on R. If you want to easily manipulate and present data, R is the tool for you.

Try R is a painless introductory tutorial to the R language, one of the most powerful tools for data analysis and statistical computing.

• Learn the basics of R syntax in this interactive, in-browser tutorial

• Run commands without having R installed—and create calculations, vectors, and graphs

• Use vectors, matrices, factors, and data frames to create powerful visualizations

• Complete our challenges and learn the world's most powerful data manipulation tool!

http://tryr.codeschool.com/

